next_path=R/'docs/NEXT_SESSION.md';prior=next_path.read_text(encoding='utf-8');assert not prior.startswith('# NEXT_SESSION — PR-PLAY-75')
next_text=f'''# NEXT_SESSION — PR-PLAY-75 closure ({now:%Y-%m-%d})

**B — PARTIAL / DYNAMIC NPC PATHWAY DEMONSTRATED.** Six actual live provider proposals committed; four final HTTP/browser NPCs completed save/resume conversation. Existing bounded ledger, ELABORATE bridge/exploration transaction, expression validator, dialogue commitments and snapshots carry the feature. Default off: ASHEN_EXPERIMENTAL_DYNAMIC_NPCS plus world-improvisation/initiative and identity-bound branching enrollment. One background identity per populated scene, six roles, bounded knowledge and eight exchanges/NPC. Greeting/thanks receipts only; no compliance or invented checks. Routine sitting on an accepted seat preserves world clocks. NPC dialogue consumes transcript turns without faction/time pressure advancement.

Final NPC 70/70; broader safety 234/234; inherited 105/105; isolated lifecycle 39/39. Frozen developer holdout ran once 85/90, with 30 multi-turn and 20 actual snapshot cases; five retained missing-optional-key checker errors. It predates target/inquiry/name guards and had weak resumed-dialogue assertions; no final-source/external holdout claim. Two final normal TCP and two typed browser campaigns pass, including hash-recorded final-source cross-load continuations. 21 browser typed submissions. All six sampled live rewordings rejected and used grounded fallback: broad AI dialogue competence remains unproven. Provider total 12 requests / 3,398 tokens / zero retries. Separate original partial HTTP traces and admission refusals preserved.

150/150 protected entry hashes unchanged. Focused 1065/20, boundary 101/6, broader 0/9 match exact PR74 failure identities; no new failures observed. Final exercised HTTP/browser scans: zero hidden/internal-key exposures, mandatory discovery omissions or critical unsafe publications. No full-suite or official ATGB claim. Mean final HTTP conversation {lat['final_http_conversation_ms']['mean']:.2f} ms, max {lat['final_http_conversation_ms']['maximum']:.2f} ms under concurrent validation; browser paint time unavailable.

Read development/campaigns/product_realization/pr_play_75 (01/04/13/18/23), artifacts/pr_play_75/metrics.json, final_source.json, source_task.diff, regression_comparison.json and browser_results.json. Archive: handoff/{archive.name}. Extensive dirty work predates entry; preserve it. No commit or push.

**Exactly one next cycle:** PR-PLAY-76 — GENERAL-PURPOSE ACTION ADJUDICATION AND ENVIRONMENTAL INTERACTION. Do not implement it in this closure or retune the frozen holdout.

---

'''
